  volume: 0.1
  storyBeats:
  - 'I''ve been driving for over 11 hours, I need to set up camp...


    There is
    a campground ahead, I need to get some sleep...'
  - "A park ranger said the campground is abandoned \n\nSince I am too tired they
    will let me stay and set up camp, so long as I remain near my campsite..."
  - 'The camp I set up is cozy enough, but this place gives me the creeps for some
    reason...


    I''m too tired to do anything else, I''m going to sleep...'
